Priority 1 has been implemented: all supervisor agent routing and fallback query parsing/formatting logic has been extracted from [`routes.py`](file:///d:/ksp-main%20%282%29/ksp-main/ksp-main/backend/routes.py) into a dedicated module [`supervisor_router.py`](file:///d:/ksp-main%20%282%29/ksp-main/ksp-main/backend/supervisor_router.py).

### 1. Created [`backend/supervisor_router.py`](file:///d:/ksp-main%20%282%29/ksp-main/ksp-main/backend/supervisor_router.py)
Extracted:
- `SUPERVISOR_ROUTER_PROMPT`: The supervisor agent system prompt.
